    - local tools behind -r (read), -w (write and edit) and -x (run
      commands), each change confirmed on the terminal
    - approval prompts are refused after 120 seconds, so an unattended
      run cannot wait forever
    - example profile for a local Ollama server
    - OpenAI-compatible endpoints are the only supported kind

